      "hardware_label": "Intel Arc Pro B70",
      "notes": "Qwen3.8 27B official FP8 target on two Intel Arc Pro B70 cards with the neural.download block-W8A16, active-width GDN, and active-Mamba allocation patches. Dynamic service uses the publisher MTP layer serially to depth 8 for one active request and depth 1 under load; every accepted draft token is verified by the unchanged official FP8 target. Fixed 12-prompt cold realistic suite, one unique request each, 128 outputs, streamed token-ID timing, prefix cache disabled, cached_tokens=0 for all requests. Conventional 99-interval median was 58.537756 tok/s on this submitted cold server; an independent second cold server measured 58.244309 tok/s. Exact evidence, patches, commands, cold-start timing, and the separately scoped 146.814418 tok/s high-acceptance fixture are in the linked result packet.",
